/ActualText (I\031m a junior designer and illustrator with a multidisciplinary background in arts, design, and multimedia, with a particular focus in service design and children\031s illustration. I find inspiration in projects that tell stories and bring people together, and I believe design is a powerful tool for accessible and meaningful communication, capable of creating solutions driven by purpose, creativity, and inclusion.\n\nI consider myself a curious, responsible person with a great desire to learn, capable of working in a team and dealing with different challenges.)
