/ActualText (I have a special interest in the areas of accessibility and universal design, inclusive design, ability-based design and design thinking, which I consider fundamental to creating truly user-centered digital experiences. Throughout my academic career, I have sought to integrate these principles into my projects, valuing research, empathy, and experimentation as an essential part of the creative process.)
