/ActualText (ABOUT\nThe impact of end-of-life pharmaceuticals on public health and the environment is a problem that exists primarily because of the users who consume these by products. As such, we have designed a service that addresses and improves this issue, either by raising awareness or by facilitating the process.\n\nPROBLEM SCOPE\nThe impact of end-of-life medications on public health and the environment, aggravated by poor disposal habits of those that are no longer needed or whose expiration date has passed.\n\nUSER/CUSTOMER SEGMENT\n1. A user who is aware of the importance of safely disposing of medications.\n2. A user who has no knowledge whatsoever about the safe disposal of medications\n\nVALUE PROPOSITION\nSecure collection just a click away. Schedule the pickup of your medications from the comfort of your home.)
/K [2]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 2515 0 R
/Pg 2063 0 R
