3812 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (ABOUT\nThis project addresses the development of a modular and scalable illustration system applied to Kranemann Wine Estates, a winery located in the Douro region, exploring the strategic role of illustrations in visual brand communication. The study is based on an in-depth analysis of the importance of visual identity in the wine market and how illustrations can reflect  the essence of a brand. This system was designed to allow flexibility  and customisation in different communication media, respecting the values and characteristics of the Douro terroir.\n\nPROBLEM SCOPE\nThe difficulty in visually sharing all the stages and respective work processes involved in the production of Port and table wines, from planting the vines to releasing the bottles onto the market. This is a particularly critical challenge when presenting the company's products to intermediate customers.)
/K [2]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3813 0 R
/Pg 3413 0 R
>>
endobj
