3814 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (METHODOLOGY\nThis project is based on the Double Diamond methodology, a visual representation to better understand the design process. The method is divided into two main phases, Research and Design, which in turn are broken down into four stages: Discover, Define, Develop and Deliver.\n\nNEEDS ASSESSMENT\nCompany's Current Approach to the Problem \222 use of generic images from  the Wine Folly website.\nIneffective and Insufficient for Kranemann\nLack of information about the Port wine production process\nUltimately, it is an impersonal solution\n\nMASTER THESIS\nCheckout more at: https://hdl.handle.net/10316/118527)
/K [3]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3815 0 R
/Pg 3413 0 R
>>
